<title>USA: Diedrich halts bid to acquire Pannikin.</title>
<headline>Diedrich halts bid to acquire Pannikin.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diedrich Coffee Inc said on Thursday that it was unable to reach final agreement in remaining negotiations and has terminated its bid to acquire substantially all of the assets of Pannikin Coffee &amp; Tea.</p>
<p>Diedrich Coffee had previously announced on Feb. 12, 1997, that it had entered into a purchase agreement with Pannikin Coffee &amp; Tea, a privately held company based in San Diego.</p>
<p>Diedrich Coffee currently operates 46 coffeehouses in Southern California, Colorado and Texas.</p>
</text>
